  "claims": [
    "The independently pinned saved opinion document is bounded and read before candidate evidence. A shared claim, sense decision, rule, definition or interpretation change requires revalidation.",
    "A changed support occurrence, review, witness, rule or resolution edition invalidates that support independently. An independently valid peer remains available.",
    "The verified fixture reports two approvals, one approval after rejection, zero approvals, stale previous opinions in the revised edition, and a re-reviewed proof for the same occurrence.",
    "The replacement proof is independently replayed with exact authenticated LD4 evolution, model, review and edition inputs, and the retained report can be replayed without publishing a new opinion."
